  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Nino Flood Response II Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will respond to the urgent humanitarian needs through the collection and production of data and its analysis to inform the delivery of humanitarian assistance while providing direct lifesaving shelter, non-food items and improving access to water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) services to crisis- affected populations.</narrative>
